<section id="services" class="manifesto"><div class="manifesto-image"></div><div class="manifesto-copy"><p class="eyebrow">VAKEMA STANDARTAS</p><h2>Detalės kuria<br /><em>ramybę.</em></h2><p>Preciziškas darbas, skaidrus bendravimas ir sprendimai, kurie tarnauja ilgiau nei viena mada.</p><a class="outline-button" href="#contact">Sužinoti daugiau <span>↗</span></a></div></section>

<style>
.manifesto{min-height:650px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:#0d0f10}
.manifesto-image{background:url('/assets/hero-house-clean.jpg') 58% center/cover;min-height:500px;filter:saturate(.82)}
.manifesto-copy{padding:120px clamp(40px,9vw,140px);align-self:center}
.manifesto h2{font-size:clamp(50px,6vw,92px);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.07em;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 30px}
.manifesto h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold);font-weight:800}
.manifesto-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#bcb9b0;line-height:1.8;max-width:390px;margin-bottom:35px}
@media(max-width:1000px){.manifesto-copy{padding:80px 50px}}
@media(max-width:720px){.manifesto{display:block}.manifesto-image{min-height:400px}.manifesto-copy{padding:80px 24px}}
</style>
